---
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';

const contactEmail = 'hello@m8tcha.com';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Acceptable Use Policy"
  description="The rules for using M8tcha safely, lawfully, and respectfully."
  updated="September 18, 2026"
>
  <p>
    This Acceptable Use Policy ("<strong>AUP</strong>") explains conduct that is not allowed on
    M8tcha. It applies to the M8tcha app, website, Rooms, events, messages, profiles, and all other
    related services (the "<strong>Services</strong>"). It supplements our{' '}
    <a href="/legal/terms">Terms of Service</a>. Capitalized terms not defined here have the meaning in
    the Terms.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Be Eligible and Truthful</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You must be at least 18 years old to use the Services.</li>
    <li>Use one account, provide accurate information, and do not impersonate another person.</li>
    <li>Do not create an account for someone else, use a bot, or misrepresent your age or identity.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
  <p>You may not use the Services to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Harass, stalk, threaten, intimidate, exploit, or endanger anyone.</li>
    <li>Publish hate speech, discriminatory abuse, threats of violence, or graphic violence.</li>
    <li>
      Engage in, facilitate, recruit for, advertise, or otherwise promote human trafficking, sex
      trafficking, or the sexual exploitation of any person.
    </li>
    <li>
      Create, possess, request, offer, share, or link to child sexual abuse material (CSAM), or
      engage in or facilitate child sexual exploitation or abuse. This includes any sexual,
      exploitative, or abusive content involving anyone under 18, whether real, fictional,
      AI-generated, or digitally altered. We have zero tolerance for this conduct.
    </li>
    <li>Share sexually explicit content, sexual solicitation, or any content involving minors.</li>
    <li>Scam, defraud, extort, solicit money, or request payment or financial credentials from users.</li>
    <li>Promote unlawful commercial activity, spam, pyramid schemes, or unauthorized advertising.</li>
    <li>Share another person's private information, images, or communications without permission.</li>
    <li>Upload malware or attempt to phish, scrape, reverse engineer, disrupt, or bypass security.</li>
    <li>Use the Services for unlawful discrimination, surveillance, or any illegal purpose.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Content and Safety</h2>
  <p>
    Only upload content you have the right to share. We may remove content, restrict visibility,
    suspend or terminate accounts, preserve evidence, and report suspected crime or urgent safety
    threats to appropriate authorities, including suspected human trafficking, sex trafficking,
    sexual exploitation, CSAM, and child sexual exploitation or abuse. We do not guarantee that
    every violation will be detected or prevented. M8tcha does not conduct criminal background
    checks or guarantee the identity or safety of any user.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Reporting</h2>
  <p>
    Use the in-app report or block tools whenever possible. For urgent safety concerns, contact local
    emergency services first. You may also email <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>
    with the username, relevant dates, and a description of the concern. Do not include unnecessary
    sensitive information.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Enforcement and Appeals</h2>
  <p>
    We assess reports using the information available to us and may take action proportionate to the
    risk, including warnings, content removal, feature limits, suspension, or termination. We may
    retain records needed for safety, fraud prevention, legal compliance, and appeals. If you believe
    enforcement was mistaken, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a> with
    the subject “AUP appeal” and the account email or username.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
